	(text "EoS MSP430G2 Board, rev A. BoosterPack-compatible (20-pin). Designed by Kartikeydheer Srivastava.\nCopyright (c) 2026 Kartikeydheer Srivastava. All rights reserved; see LICENSE.txt.\nValues from TI SLAS735J, SLAU144K, SLAU278AH, SLAU647O, SLAA322D; Silicon Labs CP2102N Rev. 1.5;\nDiodes DS37274 (AP7361C); Nexperia PMEG6010CEH v.4; Littelfuse 1206L and SP05xxBA; Abracon ABS07;\nKingbright. 16 MHz only with VCC >= 3.3 V (SLAS735J); 12 MHz from the LDO for full margin.\nJP1 (one shunt): 1-2 USB/LDO powers +3V3, 2-3 MSP-FET VCC_TOOL powers +3V3.\nJP2 off = measure the MCU alone. Firmware: XCAPx = 00 for Y1 with C10/C11."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
